Prove a rehearsal snapshot on scratch target data without production activation.
Prove a rehearsal snapshot on scratch target data without production activation.

Import original secrets first. Use the handoff from move rehearse. The test
restores scratch volumes, starts web and static workloads on an internal
network, checks them directly, and cleans up. Background workers, cron,
release jobs, public routes and DNS are excluded. The source continues
running after its capture; perform move final before a real cutover.
