Keep an app's secrets sealed on this machine.

Usage:
  helios secret [command]

Available Commands:
  copy        Give another app the same value of a secret, without showing it.
  export      Seal one secret for another machine; prints only age ciphertext.
  import      Read a secret sealed for this machine from stdin, without showing it.
  list        List the names in the current version. Values are never shown.
  recipient   Print the machine's public encryption recipient, creating its key if needed.
  remove      Drop a name from the next version.
  set         Store a value, read from stdin or typed without echo. Never pass it as an argument.
  versions    List every version and the names it holds.

